  - t1000_upgrade launch: worst column −6.48 against a −$2B bill, and a $6.48B shortfall against the $3B cap;
  - ultrafan_wb launch: no Re-engine on the record, −9.00 against a −$4B bill, and $8.02-9.00B against the $1B sub-cap;
